{"t":"Cobra Bastion","s":"cobra-bastion-22896","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Cobra_Assassin_17f275.gif","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Cobra Bastion</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Cobra Assassin\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cobra_Assassin_17f275.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">North east of Ankrahmun's desert. <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33301,32647,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33301, 32647, 7)</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">All</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Level &amp; Skills' Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvlknights\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"> <div class=\"skills-box\"> <h3 class=\"skills-box-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General\">General</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">350</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">300</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">300</span> and 100 /  (ML/Def)</div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Profit Hourly</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\">Experience</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\">Loot</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: orange\"><b>Very Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: green\"><b>Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">12.20.8834<br/>July 29, 2019<br/>Summer Update 2019</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The Cobra Bastion is the fortress of the Order of the Cobra. It is similar to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Falcon%20Bastion\">Falcon Bastion</a> both in structure and in story, since the leader of the Order of the Cobra, <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarlett%20Etzel\">Scarlett Etzel</a>, is the sister of <a href=\"#/wiki/Grand%20Master%20Oberon\">Grand Master Oberon</a>. The Bastion can only be accessed by players of level 250 or higher.\n</p><p>Part of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Grave%20Danger%20Quest\">Grave Danger Quest</a> takes part here.\n</p><p>The following secrets are hidden in the Bastion:\n</p>\n<ul><li>The Order of the Cobra Compendium is a collection of documents found in the bastion that tell the story of the Order of the Cobra.</li>\n<li>You will find several <a href=\"#/wiki/Brass-Shod%20Chest\">Brass-Shod Chests</a> in the Bastion, which can be used once every 24 hours. From them you can get a items such as Cobra Crests, <a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Ring\">Life Rings</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Death%20Ring\">Death Rings</a>, 8 <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coins</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Ingot\">Gold Ingot</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Banana%20Chocolate%20Shake\">Banana Chocolate Shake</a> and others.</li>\n<li>If you use a Flask with Snake Poison on the Large Cauldron on the second floor, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33399,32663,5\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33399, 32663, 5)</a>, all the Cobras will start spawning with 2000 fewer hitpoints. The effect lasts for 30 minutes.</li>\n<li>Sometimes while on the Bastion Island several <a href=\"#/wiki/Strange%20Rat\">Strange Rats</a> may appear at once at the character's position. It may be connected with the Cobra's Curse.</li>\n<li>While killing the mini bosses, there is a small chance that <a href=\"#/wiki/Ugly%20Monster\">Ugly Monsters</a> will spawn. If they do, you should kill them quickly, as they may drop any item of the very valuable Cobra Set.</li>\n<li>Sometimes when walking around the Bastion while another player is killing <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarlett%20Etzel\">Scarlett Etzel</a>, you will receive several orange messages from Scarlett herself. These messages seem to mention several things the character has done in the game, such as taming a <a href=\"#/wiki/Midnight%20Panther\">Midnight Panther</a> and creating a Ring of Ending. After these messages you may also see a display of The Cube Effect.</li>\n<li>You can find the Key 0303 <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33396,32640,4\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33396, 32640, 4)</a> to unlock some of the Bastion doors, including those on the floor its found.</li>\n<li>You can find a vial with oil inside a chest on the ground floor. It can be used to light on fire the vines that close the entrance to the 4th floor from the ground.</li>\n<li>If you move <a href=\"#/wiki/Gaffir\">Gaffir</a>'s corpse to the Fire Basin at the center of his room, and then step on the carpet with the price tag, you will be sent to a secret room <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33302,31196,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33302, 31196, 9)</a> where you will find the last part of the Chess Game moves needed for the <a href=\"#/wiki/Grave%20Danger%20Quest\">Grave Danger Quest</a>.</li>\n<li>On the basement, you can reach the room with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Cart%20Packed%20with%20Gold\">Cart Packed with Gold</a> after defeating <a href=\"#/wiki/Custodian\">Custodian</a>. If you protect the Cart from the Cobras and clear the path from <a href=\"#/wiki/Clutter\">Clutters</a> on its way, you can kill it at its destination where you can supposedly get a valuable loot. Furthermore, the Cart will some times drop some Wheel Oil which can be used on it to jump a few tiles.</li>\n<li>If you toss a <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a> on the floor of the balcony, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33396,32642,4\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33396, 32642, 4)</a>, several Light Effects will be displayed, as well as this message: <span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">You made it whole again... the curse is lifted.</span>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Cobra_Members\">Cobra Members</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table ce